  "comments": [
    {
      "position": 0,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "Group 1: Change the last sound of the ます-form into the え sound. E.g. やすみ「ます」->　やすめ\nGroup 2: Append ろ to the ます-form. E.g. ねろ / 寝ろ\nGroup 3: します->しろ きます->こい\n\nQuite 'rough' speech, normally only used by men or those in senior positions.",
      "html": "Group 1: Change the last sound of the ます-form into the え sound. E.g. やすみ「ます」-&gt;　やすめ<br/>Group 2: Append ろ to the ます-form. E.g. ねろ / 寝ろ<br/>Group 3: します-&gt;しろ きます-&gt;こい<br/><br/>Quite 'rough' speech, normally only used by men or those in senior positions.",
      "credits_raw": "yutenji",
      "content_sha256": "81cb816bd2bb6e1751c99b97e459037922e330b49b597c5d9489f34999e39b26",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 1,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "This construct expresses a rough negative command (\"Don't you dare do X!\"). It takes the [dictionary form] of the verb and appends 〜な to it.",
      "html": "This construct expresses a rough negative command (\"Don't you dare do X!\"). It takes the [dictionary form] of the verb and appends 〜な to it.",
      "credits_raw": "FekketCantenel",
      "content_sha256": "b1e77e68a634b7b107e7eb9453bc5a14fbd3db319131601623d66e0224ffa360",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 2,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "Formed from dictionary form verb + na\n\nVru = 'Dictionary' form verb (e.g. 歩く、する、いる)",
      "html": "Formed from dictionary form verb + na<br/><br/>Vru = 'Dictionary' form verb (e.g. 歩く、する、いる)",
      "credits_raw": "Amatuka",
      "content_sha256": "6ef4c474372ef8de8fdbe733912f2b00d190cee4ddf012a3da05a330d6d98b2b",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 3,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "ふざけるな！　(they often say it in anime etc. means\nsomething like... how to say it... 'stop that!',\n'don't make me a fool')",
      "html": "ふざけるな！　(they often say it in anime etc. means<br/>something like... how to say it... 'stop that!',<br/>'don't make me a fool')",
      "credits_raw": "hassan",
      "content_sha256": "d654c813e3d8fad5cacd339e7f732086fc492076125ec7c1bc313b1f121c9a96",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 4,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "ふせげるな？",
      "html": "ふせげるな？",
      "credits_raw": "anon",
      "content_sha256": "2936f8f121b71c3acb35a5284d376cbfbc12ddfd4a48ea028cbf1a2b87108c98",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 5,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "We don't say ふせげるな! but we say ふせぐな！ 防ぐ+な\nふざける is 'Dictionary' form verb and not potential form. ふざけるな can be also said as ふざけるんじゃない",
      "html": "We don't say ふせげるな! but we say ふせぐな！ 防ぐ+な<br/>ふざける is 'Dictionary' form verb and not potential form. ふざけるな can be also said as ふざけるんじゃない",
      "credits_raw": "Miki",
      "content_sha256": "b646865b1b537c13189fabbf8f47ce243d63d9b46d186f8a974ad5626b715392",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 6,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "ふざけるな　or ふざけないで meaning : \" don't/ stop messing around and behave yourself\"\nふざける = basic meaning is \" to play around\", \"to mess about\" but can also mean \" to talk nonsense\".",
      "html": "ふざけるな　or ふざけないで meaning : \" don't/ stop messing around and behave yourself\"<br/>ふざける = basic meaning is \" to play around\", \"to mess about\" but can also mean \" to talk nonsense\".",
      "credits_raw": "誠",
      "content_sha256": "a21160647338b94bc57033c25634f686485c46521a7902cada792f67337b3111",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    }
  ],
